# Normalize text files to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (common on Windows) rewrites the
# committed build artefacts to CRLF during a git-dependency checkout,
# which changes their byte size and makes integrity diffs noisy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Build artefacts are generated single-file bundles. Keep their bytes
# exactly as produced by esbuild — no EOL conversion, no diff noise.
dist/index.js -text
client.js -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.tgz binary
